# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your knowledge of tools for handling noise and errors and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Kumuha ng 20-tanong na exam sa site ng IBM Training para subukin ang kaalaman mo sa mga tool para sa paghawak ng noise at mga error at tumanggap ng badge sa pamamagitan ng Credly."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam  | Tools for quantum advantage"
msgstr "Exam  | Mga tool para sa quantum advantage"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Exam at badge {#exam-and-badge}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/tools-for-quantum-advantage/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/tools-for-quantum-advantage/badge.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Subukin ang kaalaman mo {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for General formulation of quantum information.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos makumpleto ang pagbabasa at mga aktibidad sa kursong ito, i-click ang button sa ibaba para pumunta sa IBM Training, kung saan maaari mong kunin ang badging exam para sa General formulation of quantum information.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "Binubuo ang exam ng 20 tanong, at kailangan mong sumagot nang tama ng hindi bababa sa 16 para pumasa. Kapag nakakuha ka ng pumasang score, awtomatikong ipapadala ang badge mo sa email na ginamit mo sa pagrehistro sa IBM Training.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking handa ka nang kunin ang exam. Kung hindi ka nakakuha ng pumasang score sa loob ng dalawang pagtatangka, pansamantalang magla-lock ang exam.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr "Paunawa: Maaaring pansamantalang hindi available ang mga exam na ito sa site ng IBM Training sa susunod na ilang araw dahil sa maintenance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/tools-for-quantum-advantage-badge-quiz-DL46113G\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/).\n"
msgstr "PAUNAWA: Gumagamit ang IBM ng mga serbisyo ng Credly, isang third-party na data processor na pinahintulutan ng IBM at nasa United States, para tumulong sa pangangasiwa ng IBM Digital Badge program. Upang mag-isyu sa iyo ng IBM Digital Badge, ibabahagi sa Credly ang iyong personal na impormasyon (pangalan, email address, at nakuhang badge). Makakatanggap ka ng email notification mula sa Credly na may mga tagubilin sa pag-claim ng badge. Ginagamit ang iyong personal na impormasyon para i-isyu ang iyong badge at para sa pag-uulat ng programa at mga layuning operasyonal. Maaaring ibahagi ng IBM ang nakolektang personal na impormasyon sa mga subsidiary ng IBM at sa mga third party sa buong mundo. Hahawakan ito sa paraang naaayon sa mga kasanayan sa privacy ng IBM. Makikita ang IBM Privacy Statement [dito](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/).\n"
